[Unit]
Description=Weekly Trivy CVE scan of container images
Documentation=file:///home/pi/Projects/Server/4-Security-Monitoring/README.md

[Timer]
# Sundays 04:10, no random delay: the image lists of beefy and tower are read over ssh in the first seconds, while beefy is up (03:55 to about 04:26); the Trivy part then runs on fastpi against the registry and needs neither host. Weekly rather than daily: CVE feeds move on roughly that cadence, and a daily 1.4G DB refresh plus 60 image scans on a Pi buys nothing.
OnCalendar=Sun *-*-* 04:10:00
Persistent=true

[Install]
WantedBy=timers.target
